msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Number of Components"
msgstr "Aantal componenten"

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Number of Factors"
msgstr "Aantal factoren"

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid ""
"Here, the number of components/factors that are used in the analysis is "
"determined. Several methods to determine this number can be chosen from:"
msgstr "Hier wordt het aantal componenten/factoren bepaald dat in de analyse wordt gebruikt. Er kunnen verschillende methoden worden gekozen om dit aantal te bepalen:"

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Based on"
msgstr "Op basis van"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Parallel analysis"
msgstr "Parallel analyse"

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid ""
"Components/factors are selected on the basis of parallel analysis. With this "
"method, factors are selected when their eigenvalue is greater than the "
"parallel average random eigenvalue. This method is selected by default. Can "
"be based on principal component eigenvalues (PC) or factor eigenvalues (FA). "
"A seed (1234) is chosen by default so that the results from the parallel "
"analysis are equal across the PCA"
msgstr "Componenten/factoren worden geselecteerd op basis van parallelanalyse. Met deze methode worden factoren geselecteerd wanneer hun eigenwaarde groter is dan de parallelle gemiddelde willekeurige eigenwaarde. Deze methode is standaard geselecteerd. Kan gebaseerd zijn op eigenwaarden van principale componenten (PC) of factor-eigenwaarden (FA). Standaard wordt een seed (1234) gekozen zodat de resultaten van de parallelanalyse gelijk zijn over de PCA"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Based on PC"
msgstr "Gebaseerd op PC"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Based on FA"
msgstr "Gebaseerd op FA"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Eigenvalues"
msgstr "Eigenwaarden"

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid ""
"Components are selected when they have a certain eigenvalue. By default "
"components are selected that have an eigenvalue above 1."
msgstr "Componenten worden geselecteerd wanneer ze een bepaalde eigenwaarde hebben. Standaard worden componenten geselecteerd die een eigenwaarde boven 1 hebben."

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Eigenvalues above"
msgstr "Eigenwaarden boven"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "Handmatig"

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid ""
"The number of components can be specified manually. By default this is set "
"to 1."
msgstr "Het aantal componenten kan handmatig worden opgegeven. Standaard is dit ingesteld op 1."

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Number of components"
msgstr "Aantal componenten"

